  "description": "In-situ resource utilization on the Moon: lightweight regolith excavation (RASSOR bucket drum, pneumatic) at 30-50 kg/h, oxygen extraction by molten regolith electrolysis (~900 kg O2 per metric ton regolith) and H2 reduction of ilmenite (FeTiO3) at 1000C, water ice mining from permanently shadowed craters at -240C (Shackleton, 5-8% water from LCROSS), and Fe/Al/Ti metal extraction via molten oxide electrolysis and carbonyl processing.",
